    "Description": "CA-07c component-collection CONSUMER demo. Instance blueprint. Tick graph: GetComponent<BpCollectionDemo>(self) exposes its \"Values\" virtual collection (CA-07a, curated BpCollectionDemoOps accessors), fanned out into all three CA-07b consumer nodes -- ComponentForEach (mirrors CurrentItem into LoopLastItem each iteration), ComponentItemGet (Index=0 literal -> ElementOut), ComponentItemCount (-> CountOut). Every consumer's ComponentTypeFqn/accessor FQNs are authored here exactly as the CA-07c wire-bake hook (BlueprintCommandSink.TryBakeCollectionConsumer) would bake them live when the designer drags the wire in the editor. Pair with GetComponentDemo/GetComponentTargetDemo/SetComponentDemo (scalar-field demos).",
